# swifphSecretReset()
@fast
@player &#fc893d&lTetration&r: &#fc893dBetter luck next time!

@bypass /attribute @s minecraft:jump_strength base set 0
@bypass /attribute @s minecraft:movement_speed base set 0

@delay 2s

@bypass /attribute @s minecraft:jump_strength base set 0
@bypass /attribute @s minecraft:movement_speed base set 0
@bypass /minecraft:tp @s -9216.5 51.00 9481.5
@bypass playsound minecraft:entity.enderman.teleport master @s
@bypass execute at @s run particle minecraft:witch ~ ~ ~ 0 1 0 1 20 normal

@bypass /clear @s chorus_fruit
@bypass /give @s chorus_fruit
